      "caveats": [
        "The audio is restored by a speech restoration model (Miipher), not a raw recording: unsuitable as a class A or G signal-quality negative.",
        "dev.clean holds 40 speakers and test.clean 39; audio is 24 kHz.",
        "No speaker gender: LibriTTS's SPEAKERS.txt is not in this mirror and no pinnable source for it was found on the allowed hosts, so its clips carry none and the class E impostor injectors, which draw same-language, same-gender donors, do not use them."
      ],
